    "text": "The resistance of each straight section is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math>.&nbsp;Find the equivalent resistance (in ohms) between <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>.<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0027_11103c357810.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 270px; height: 123px;\" />"
